message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "HyperNav: A φ-Jump Navigation Engine for N-Dimensional Spaces"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
authors:
  - family-names: "Ziyavutdinov"
    given-names: "Magomed Kamalovich"
    alias: "Zimaka"
    email: "zimakam@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-9212-9921"
abstract: >
  HyperNav is the first navigation engine for N-dimensional spaces based on
  φ-jump topology (⌊n/φ⌋) and Merkaba-γ lag. Time is more important than
  distance.
keywords:
  - "hyperdimensional navigation"
  - "phi topology"
  - "golden ratio"
  - "Fibonacci graph"
  - "A* algorithm"
